msgstr ""

#: includes/class-pncp-admin.php:1526
msgid "On a VPS or a dedicated server, fail2ban can read these lines and block the IP in the server's firewall for the same time, so a blocked scraper no longer reaches PHP at all. The filter and the jail to copy are on the “Server rules” tab. On shared hosting leave it off: nobody reads that log."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-pncp-admin.php:1528
